<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>{{ title }} — TechoSolutions</title>
<meta name="description" content="{{ excerpt }}">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@100..900&family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,100..800;1,100..800&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/tokens.css">
<script id="counterscale-script" data-site-id="techosolutions-in" src="https://counterscale.techosolutionsin.workers.dev/tracker.js" defer></script>
<style>
*, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
html { overflow-x: clip; scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 5rem; }
body { overflow-x: clip; font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.6; color: var(--color-ink); background: var(--color-paper); -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale; }
img, svg { display: block; max-width: 100%; }
a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
::selection { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-ink); }
:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus); outline-offset: 3px; }

h1, h2, h3, h4 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 600; font-style: normal; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -0.02em; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; }
h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw + 0.5rem, 3rem); letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.1; }
h2 { font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw + 0.5rem, 2.25rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
h3 { font-size: var(--text-xl); }
.container { width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: clamp(var(--space-md), 4vw, var(--space-3xl)); }

.nav { position: fixed; top: var(--space-md); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); z-index: var(--z-sticky); width: fit-content; max-width: calc(100vw - var(--space-xl)); background: var(--color-nav-bg); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px); backdrop-filter: blur(16px); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius-full); padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-sm); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-lg); }
.nav__wordmark { font-family: var(--font-outlier); font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.9375rem; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--color-ink); white-space: nowrap; padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-sm); }
.nav__wordmark span { color: var(--color-accent); }
.nav__links { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2xs); list-style: none; }
.nav__link { font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-muted); padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-sm); border-radius: var(--radius-full); transition: color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), background var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out); white-space: nowrap; }
.nav__link:hover { color: var(--color-ink); background: var(--color-paper-2); }
.nav__link--active { color: var(--color-ink); background: var(--color-paper-3); }
.nav__cta { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-ink) !important; font-weight: 600; padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-md) !important; }
.nav__cta:hover { background: var(--color-accent-2) !important; color: var(--color-accent-ink) !important; }
.nav__toggle { display: none; background: none; border: none; color: var(--color-ink); font-size: var(--text-xl); cursor: pointer; padding: var(--space-2xs); }

.article { padding-block: calc(var(--space-4xl) + 4rem) var(--space-4xl); }
.article__meta { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-md); margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-accent); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; }
.article__meta time { color: var(--color-muted); text-transform: none; letter-spacing: 0; }
.article h1 { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); }
.article__body { margin-top: var(--space-2xl); }
.article__body p { margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); font-size: var(--text-base); line-height: 1.75; color: var(--color-ink-2); }
.article__body h2 { margin-top: var(--space-2xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }
.article__body h3 { margin-top: var(--space-xl); margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
.article__body ul, .article__body ol { margin: 0 0 var(--space-lg) var(--space-lg); }
.article__body li { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); line-height: 1.65; color: var(--color-ink-2); }
.article__body strong { color: var(--color-ink); }
.article__body em { color: var(--color-ink); }
.article__body blockquote { border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent); padding-left: var(--space-lg); margin: var(--space-lg) 0; font-size: var(--text-md); color: var(--color-ink); font-style: italic; }
.article__body blockquote cite { display: block; font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); font-style: normal; margin-top: var(--space-xs); }
.article__body hr { border: none; border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); margin: var(--space-2xl) 0; }
.article__body a { color: var(--color-accent); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }
.article__body a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); }
.article__body code { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 0.9em; background: var(--color-paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); padding: 0.1em 0.4em; }

.article__footer-cta { background: var(--color-paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: var(--space-xl); margin-top: var(--space-3xl); text-align: center; }
.article__footer-cta h3 { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
.article__footer-cta p { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); margin-bottom: var(--space-md); }

.btn { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: var(--space-xs); font-family: var(--font-body); font-size: var(--text-sm); font-weight: 600; padding: var(--space-sm) var(--space-xl); border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: transform var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), background var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out), box-shadow var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out); white-space: nowrap; }
.btn:hover { transform: translateY(-1.5px); }
.btn:active { transform: translateY(0px); }
.btn--primary { background: var(--color-accent); color: var(--color-accent-ink); }
.btn--primary:hover { background: var(--color-accent-2); box-shadow: 0 4px 20px var(--color-accent-2); }

.footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule); padding-block: var(--space-xl); }
.footer__inner { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-md); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.footer__copy { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); }
.footer__links { display: flex; gap: var(--space-lg); list-style: none; }
.footer__links a { font-size: var(--text-sm); color: var(--color-muted); transition: color var(--dur-micro) var(--ease-out); }
.footer__links a:hover { color: var(--color-ink); }

@media (max-width: 60rem) {
  .nav__links { display: none; }
  .nav__toggle { display: block; }
  .nav.is-open .nav__links { display: flex; flex-direction: column; position: absolute; top: calc(100% + var(--space-xs)); left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: var(--color-paper-2); border: 1px solid var(--color-rule); border-radius: var(--radius-md); padding: var(--space-sm); min-width: 200px; gap: var(--space-2xs); }
}
@media (max-width: 40rem) {
  h1 { font-size: var(--text-2xl); }
  .nav { padding: var(--space-2xs) var(--space-sm); }
  .footer__inner { flex-direction: column; text-align: center; }
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
  *, *::before, *::after { animation-duration: 0.01ms !important; animation-iteration-count: 1 !important; transition-duration: 150ms !important; }
  html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav class="nav" role="navigation" aria-label="Navegación principal">
  <a href="/" class="nav__wordmark">tech<span>o</span>solutions</a>
  <button class="nav__toggle" aria-label="Menú" aria-expanded="false">
    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="4" y1="6" x2="20" y2="6"/><line x1="4" y1="12" x2="20" y2="12"/><line x1="4" y1="18" x2="20" y2="18"/></svg>
  </button>
  <ul class="nav__links">
    <li><a href="/" class="nav__link">Inicio</a></li>
    <li><a href="/servicios/" class="nav__link">Servicios</a></li>
    <li><a href="/blog/" class="nav__link nav__link--active">Blog & Recursos</a></li>
    <li><a href="/casos/" class="nav__link">Casos</a></li>
    <li><a href="/sobre-mi/" class="nav__link">Sobre mí</a></li>
    <li><a href="/contacto/" class="nav__link nav__cta">Contacto</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<article class="article">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="article__meta">
      <span>{{ category }}</span>
      <time datetime="{{ date.toISOString().slice(0, 10) }}">{{ date | readableDate }}</time>
    </div>
    <h1>{{ title }}</h1>
    <div class="article__body">
      {{ content | safe }}
    </div>
    <div class="article__footer-cta">
      <h3>¿Tu sistema tiene señales de estos problemas?</h3>
      <p>Una auditoría de 48 horas te dice exactamente por dónde empezar.</p>
      <a href="/contacto/" class="btn btn--primary">Quiero una auditoría</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</article>

<footer class="footer" role="contentinfo">
  <div class="container footer__inner">
    <p class="footer__copy">© 2026 TechoSolutions — Arquitectura de software que paga dividendos</p>
    <ul class="footer__links">
      <li><a href="/sobre-mi/">Sobre mí</a></li>
      <li><a href="/servicios/">Servicios</a></li>
      <li><a href="/blog/">Blog & Recursos</a></li>
      <li><a href="/casos/">Casos</a></li>
      <li><a href="/contacto/">Contacto</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
document.querySelector('.nav__toggle')?.addEventListener('click', function() {
  const nav = this.closest('.nav');
  const expanded = nav.classList.toggle('is-open');
  this.setAttribute('aria-expanded', expanded);
});
document.querySelectorAll('.nav__link').forEach(link => {
  link.addEventListener('click', () => {
    document.querySelector('.nav')?.classList.remove('is-open');
  });
});
</script>
</body>
</html>
